spice
* NMOS and PMOS transistors
M1 Y X 0 0 NMOS
M2 V_DD V_b Y V_DD PMOS

* Resistors
R_L V_DD V_out 1k ; assume 1k Ohm, specify the actual value as needed
R_S V_in X 1k ; assume 1k Ohm, specify the actual value as needed

* Capacitors
C_GD1 X Y 1p ; assume 1pF, specify the actual value as needed

* Voltage source
V_DD V_DD 0 DC 5V ; assume 5V, specify the actual value as needed

* End of netlist